    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPER SHAPESHOOTER</strong> is a fast-paced, top-down, stylized survival action game. Take on relentless waves of enemy shapes as you fight for your survival. Save up your credits, make risky choices, and construct the perfect build to make your way through to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-Length</strong> - A full run takes around 20 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocks</strong> - New items have to be unlocked by completing unique challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Wield</strong> - Wield two weapons at once, combining different firing patterns and weapon types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop</strong> - Spend your hard earned credits between waves to buy new weapons, trinkets and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wager</strong> - You decide how difficult a wave will be.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities</strong> - Use powerful abilities ranging from screen-clearing explosions to companion turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets</strong> - Buy and equip unique trinkets which provide stat boosts, special abilities or game-changing modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consumables</strong> - Buy one time consumable items which modify the rules of the game without taking up any inventory space!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Waves to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Consumables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Unique Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique bosses to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty more to come with future content updates.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
